# src/apps/daemon/internal/foundation/secrets

## Purpose
Secret-store interface plus platform/file adapters; secret persistence and retrieval stay behind this module.

## Architectural role
- Daemon dependency band: `foundation` (rank 0; lower rank = deeper implementation).
- Cross-band imports may point only to a lower rank. Same-band imports are allowed when they remain within one architectural layer.

## Contents
- Direct files (13): `file_store.go`, `platform_store_darwin.go`, `platform_store_darwin_cgo.go`, `platform_store_darwin_test.go`, `platform_store_linux.go`, `platform_store_linux_test.go`, `platform_store_other.go`, `platform_store_unavailable_test.go`, `platform_store_windows.go`, `platform_store_windows_test.go`, `runtime_path.go`, `store.go` …

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Go package: `secrets`.
- Notable exported surface: `DDNSConfig`, `DPAPIStore`, `ErrNativeStoreUnavailable`, `ErrNotFound`, `FileStore`, `GetStore`, `KeychainStore`, `NativeStore`, `NewFileStore`, `OpenNativeStore` …
- Daemon-local dependencies: none.
- Direct daemon callers: `cmd`, `internal/foundation/config`, `internal/foundation/crypto`.

## Invariants
- `foundation` code must not import a higher-rank daemon band.

